00:17:05,770 --> 00:17:08,940
Phoebe, why don't we go upstairs and have some birthday cake?

256
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:12,940
No, I just feel like being by myself for a while, all right? I'll see you guys later.

257
00:17:13,110 --> 00:17:14,490
Thanks.

258
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:17,360
Oh, poor Pheebs.

259
00:17:17,610 --> 00:17:21,120
Hey, you know what, you guys? I think I'm gonna go walk her home.

260
00:17:24,540 --> 00:17:27,120
- Oh, man.     - What?

261
00:17:27,290 --> 00:17:29,290
He's gonna eat the cake.

262
00:17:31,130 --> 00:17:32,500
Pheebs. Wait up.

263
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,300
Listen, I...

264
00:17:35,170 --> 00:17:36,300
Close your eyes.

265
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,900
Maybe that's one you can cross off your list.

266
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:56,320
Oh, yeah. Heh.

267
00:17:57,490 --> 00:18:00,280
Oh, and plus, I'm one-sixteenth Portuguese.

268
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:09,500
Okay, is everybody clear? We're gonna pick it up...

269
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,340
...and move it.

270
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:18,670
All we need is teamwork, okay? We're gonna lift the car...

271
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:22,010
...and slide it out.

272
00:18:23,890 --> 00:18:25,100
Lift...

273
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:27,600
...and slide.

274
00:18:27,770 --> 00:18:30,520
- Ross, I really don't think this...     - Lift...

275
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:33,860
...and slide.

276
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:36,690
- Okay, here we go.     - All right, everyone.

277
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,570
Lift...

278
00:18:42,410 --> 00:18:44,450
...and slide.

279
00:18:48,580 --> 00:18:52,460
- Hey, Joey...     - Oh, come on, Rach, my turn just started.

280
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,920
Actually, I just want to talk to Tag.

281
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:59,130
Oh, okay. Hey, can I ride this outside?

282
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,880
- Whatever, okay? I'm not your mother.     - Okay.

283
00:19:02,430 --> 00:19:04,140
- Not in the street!     - Yeah.

284
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,600
- Hey.     - Hey.

285
00:19:07,770 --> 00:19:12,850
- How you doing, you feeling any better?     - Yeah, I'm doing okay. I'm, um...

286
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:16,110
- Let's talk.     - Okay.

287
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,570
- Um...     - What's up?

288
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:21,150
Uh, Tag, um...

289
00:19:21,570 --> 00:19:25,070
You're such a great guy, and we have so much fun together.

290
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,490
- But I...     - Wait.

291
00:19:27,450 --> 00:19:29,410
I think I see where you're going.

292
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:33,370
But before you say anything else, can I just say one more thing?

293
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,260
Well said.

294
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:48,890
And a, uh, good example of the fun I was referring to.

295
00:19:49,430 --> 00:19:55,270
Uh, but, heh, I think I'm past the point where I can, you know, just have fun.

296
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:58,980
Rachel, don't do this. This is just because you're turning 30.

297
00:19:59,190 --> 00:20:00,990
Yeah, it is.

298
00:20:01,490 --> 00:20:04,950
But you're just a kid. I mean, you're 25.

299
00:20:05,450 --> 00:20:07,780
- Twenty-four, actually.     - Oh, God.

300
00:20:10,290 --> 00:20:15,170
You know what I wish? I wish you were six years older.

301
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:19,800
Well, actually, if I'm wishing for stuff, I actually wish I was six years younger.

302
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:23,630
- Me too.     - Yeah. I'm sorry.

303
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,980
Hey, how'd it go?

304
00:20:34,190 --> 00:20:35,390
Oh.

305
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:40,070
If I only want two kids, can I keep him for another year?

306
00:20:41,490 --> 00:20:43,320
You did the right thing.

307
00:20:47,870 --> 00:20:50,080
I don't like this anymore.

308
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:58,170
Well, here we are. Just a bunch of 30-year-olds.

309
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:03,670
Wow, do you realize in 10 years we're gonna be 40?

310
00:21:07,010 --> 00:21:12,010
Why, God? Why are you doing this to us?

311
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:22,690
Yes. My baby's finally free.

312
00:21:22,860 --> 00:21:24,190
All right.

313
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:26,860
Start it up. Let's go.

314
00:21:28,620 --> 00:21:30,240
Whoo-hoo!

315
00:21:35,870 --> 00:21:37,420
How hot are we?

316
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:47,220
You wanna buy a car?

